e work-status line, streaming thoughts, double-Esc rollback, context progress bar + TPS gauge. ⭐3689 · Team pick…","omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar — Open sidebar foundation: third-party tab registration plus built-in file rendering/editing, terminal, side chat, Git, and sub-agent pages. ⭐3842 · Team pick 2026-09-27 · post","JackZo400/dsh-voice-transcribe — Local speech-to-text for dsh: SILK decoding + SenseVoice (sherpa-onnx int8), no API cost, about 0.1 s per clip.","leolee9086/SACsearch — Multi-engine meta-search plugin for DeepSeek Harness: roughly 200 API-key-free search engines, zero runtime dependencies.","qujinting/dsh-web-search-clinepass — DSH plugin (DeepSeek Harness): a websearch provider that searches with the session's selected model via gateway-native search tools, replacing the built-in DeepSeek-only provider."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"98f58337d01c8860d40309d7f3d81c6b4e13c5af3be0d84024b886e22aaa9325","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:48:03.046Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:48:03.046Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A curated list of plugins, skills, MCP servers, patch/profile layers, orchestrators, aggregators & UIs for DeepSeek Harness (DSH) — DeepSeek's official agent runtime built around the idea Model + Harness = Agent.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"api_key","status":"not_required","text":"keenableai/dsh-keenable — Keenable web search and page fetch for DeepSeek Harness, no API key needed.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"RafaGonzalezDev/dsh-codex-oauth — DeepSeek Harness plugin that connects a ChatGPT plan through Sign in with ChatGPT and the official OpenAI Responses API.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"hongbaiqi/dsh-model-account-login — Persistent DSH model-account authorization UI for ChatGPT, Claude, and other llm-pi-ai login flows.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"api_key","status":"required","text":"AnkoCD/dsh-server-deployment — DeepSeek Harness multi-user server deployment: login portal, per-user isolated instances with OS-level isolation, independent API keys, and a delivery-file drawer; file access runs through a privilege-dropping sudo helper (fixes issue #1 TOCTOU).","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"required","text":"wjun19/dsh-trae-connect — Trae subscription model provider for DeepSeek Harness: web OAuth login, custom SSE translation, model allowlist, and a credits dashboard.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"paid_service","status":"not_required","text":"orrinzeng/dsh-cursor-subscription — Log directly into your Cursor account within DeepSeek Harness and use your Cursor subscription — no API Key required, and no dependency on Cursor IDE or Cursor CLI.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"98f58337d01c8860d40309d7f3d81c6b4e13c5af3be0d84024b886e22aaa9325","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:48:03.053Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-06T13:01:06Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Dominic789654/awesome-deepseek-harness/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:48:03.079Z","hash":"98f58337d01c8860d40309d7f3d81c6b4e13c5af3be0d84024b886e22aaa9325","originalBytes":1406823,"storedBytes":1406823,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["deepseek","harness","dsh",